{"nodes":[{"id":"root","type":"text","text":"# R5 C模式轻量工作台｜一场戏跑一轮\n\n先选本场使用的专业章节与同名十元规整章，再运行对象—关系—端点—行为—回应—结算—下一轮。","x":-350,"y":-850,"width":1000,"height":400,"color":"4"},{"id":"main","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/专业课程_R5逐章十元规整主工作台.canvas","x":-1650,"y":-820,"width":850,"height":320,"color":"4"},{"id":"regindex","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/07_逐章十元规整/00_逐章十元规整总表.md","x":850,"y":-820,"width":850,"height":320,"color":"5"},{"id":"in","type":"group","label":"① 选章与输入","x":-2700,"y":-200,"width":1550,"height":2450,"color":"3"},{"id":"chapter","type":"text","text":"### 本场调用章节\n专业知识章：\n同名十元规整章：\n课程证据：\n表现方法：\n\n没有同名规整章，不进入本轮。","x":-2500,"y":30,"width":1150,"height":500,"color":"3"},{"id":"object","type":"text","text":"### 对象与状态\n对象｜控制者｜可见性｜稀缺度｜权限｜允许／禁止行为｜当前功能","x":-2500,"y":650,"width":1150,"height":380,"color":"3"},{"id":"rel","type":"text","text":"### 场景前关系\n信任｜权力差｜距离｜依赖｜债务｜信息差｜关系定义权","x":-2500,"y":1150,"width":1150,"height":380,"color":"6"},{"id":"trigger","type":"text","text":"### 触发器\n什么具体变化使旧状态不能继续？","x":-2500,"y":1650,"width":1150,"height":300,"color":"6"},{"id":"run","type":"group","label":"② C动态运行","x":-850,"y":-200,"width":2700,"height":2450,"color":"5"},{"id":"endpoints","type":"text","text":"### 当前十元端点\n源端点：\n目标端点：\n候选关系：\n正本状态：已锁定／待确认\n\n对象或动作名称不能直接填节点。","x":-650,"y":30,"width":1050,"height":520,"color":"5"},{"id":"mechanism","type":"text","text":"### 启动机制\n源端点怎样改变目标端点？\n被改变变量是什么？\n成立阶段、体量、顺序是什么？\n第三因素是什么？","x":600,"y":30,"width":1050,"height":520,"color":"5"},{"id":"action","type":"text","text":"### 行为\n行动者实际做什么？\n行为目的是什么？\n改变谁的选择权、资源、信息、边界或关系位置？","x":-650,"y":710,"width":1050,"height":470,"color":"6"},{"id":"response","type":"text","text":"### 独立回应\n对方依据自己的欲望、信息和权力怎样回应？\n接受／协商／回避／反制／撤离／牺牲……","x":600,"y":710,"width":1050,"height":470,"color":"6"},{"id":"cost","type":"text","text":"### 结算\n即时收益｜即时／延迟／转移代价\n对象状态变化｜关系七变量变化\n拿掉测试｜反向测试","x":-650,"y":1380,"width":1050,"height":470,"color":"2"},{"id":"next","type":"text","text":"### 下一轮\n新对象状态：\n新关系位置：\n新可用行为：\n下一触发器：\n十元端点是否重分配？\n下一轮需要换哪个专业章？","x":600,"y":1380,"width":1050,"height":520,"color":"4"},{"id":"out","type":"group","label":"③ 输出与反证","x":2150,"y":-200,"width":1950,"height":2450,"color":"2"},{"id":"scene","type":"text","text":"### 场景／分镜输出\n把机制转成动作、空间、台词、停顿、镜头、颜色和声音。\n表现章只能显影机制，不能替代机制。","x":2350,"y":30,"width":1550,"height":430,"color":"2"},{"id":"proof","type":"text","text":"### 逐章证据卡\n调用章节与规整章\n正例／误判／反例\n正本关系版本\n第三因素排除\n课程来源等级","x":2350,"y":590,"width":1550,"height":430,"color":"2"},{"id":"check","type":"text","text":"### 防遗忘\n- zx克n，zx被xn克\n- 共现不等于关系\n- 动词不等于十元\n- 对象不天然等于十元\n- 课程名不等于十元\n- 视觉气氛不等于十元\n- 五维是链条结果","x":2350,"y":1150,"width":1550,"height":560,"color":"1"},{"id":"done","type":"text","text":"### 一轮完成标准\n专业章与规整章成对调用\n行为与回应成立\n至少一个变量真实变化\n代价成为下一场条件\n端点重新分配并可继续运行","x":2350,"y":1850,"width":1550,"height":330,"color":"4"}],"edges":[{"id":"1","fromNode":"main","fromSide":"right","toNode":"root","toSide":"left"},{"id":"2","fromNode":"root","fromSide":"right","toNode":"regindex","toSide":"left"},{"id":"3","fromNode":"chapter","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"object","toSide":"top"},{"id":"4","fromNode":"object","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"rel","toSide":"top"},{"id":"5","fromNode":"rel","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"trigger","toSide":"top"},{"id":"6","fromNode":"trigger","fromSide":"right","toNode":"endpoints","toSide":"left","label":"进入C运行"},{"id":"7","fromNode":"endpoints","fromSide":"right","toNode":"mechanism","toSide":"left"},{"id":"8","fromNode":"mechanism","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"action","toSide":"top"},{"id":"9","fromNode":"action","fromSide":"right","toNode":"response","toSide":"left"},{"id":"10","fromNode":"response","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"cost","toSide":"top"},{"id":"11","fromNode":"cost","fromSide":"right","toNode":"next","toSide":"left"},{"id":"12","fromNode":"next","fromSide":"right","toNode":"scene","toSide":"left"},{"id":"13","fromNode":"scene","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"proof","toSide":"top"},{"id":"14","fromNode":"proof","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"done","toSide":"top"}]}